<h3>
	After installation
</h3>
<p>
	To set up synchronization with the Apple School Manager, enter the Apple School Manager SFTP
	username and password in the
	<a href="https://docs.software-univention.de/app-provider.html#app-settings" target="_blank">App
	Settings</a>.
</p>
<p>
	The
	<a href="https://docs.software-univention.de/apple-school-manager-connector/" target="_blank">Apple
	School Manager Connector manual</a> describes where to obtain those credentials, which data the
	connector synchronizes, and how to configure it.
</p>
